-         column  Message
-         column  Note
-         row  `CannotExecuteGit`  1  _the `git` command could not be executed_
-         row  `NoRepository(path)`  2  _`path` is not a Git repository_  raised when opening
-         row  `NoWorktree`  3  _the repository has no working tree_  so it cannot be opened as a `Git.Worktree`
-         row  `Moved(ref, expected, actual)`  4  _`ref` was `expected` when read but is now `actual`_  a compare-and-swap failed; either hash may be `Unset`, rendered _nothing_; `ref` is named as the caller used it (`HEAD`), as git does
-         row  `NoSuchRef(ref)`  5  _the reference `ref` does not exist_
-         row  `NoSuchObject(hash)`  6  _the object `hash` does not exist_
-         row  `RefExists(ref)`  7  _the reference `ref` already exists_
-         row  `Unmerged(branch, tip)`  8  _the branch `branch` at `tip` is not fully merged_  `deleteBranch` refused without `force`
-         row  `Conflict(paths)`  9  _there are conflicts in `paths`_
-         row  `NothingToCommit`  10  _there is nothing to commit_  the tree is unchanged and `allowEmpty` was not given
-         row  `Detached`  11  _HEAD is detached_  where a branch was needed (`pull`)
-         row  `Dirty(paths)`  12  _local changes would be overwritten in `paths`_
-         row  `NotFastForward`  13  _the update is not a fast-forward_
-         row  `OutsideWorktree(path)`  14  _`path` is outside the working tree_
-         row  `Untracked(path)`  15  _`path` is not tracked_
-         row  `NoOperationInProgress`  16  _no merge, rebase, cherry-pick or revert is in progress_
-         row  `OperationInProgress(operation)`  17  _an operation is already in progress_
-         row  `NoSuchRemote(name)`  18  _the remote `name` does not exist_
-         row  `RemoteExists(name)`  19  _the remote `name` already exists_
-         row  `Unauthorized(remote)`  20  _authentication with `remote` failed_
-         row  `Unreachable(remote)`  21  _the remote `remote` could not be reached_
-         row  `RemoteRejected(ref, reason)`  22  _the remote rejected `ref`: `reason`_
-         row  `LeaseFailed(ref, expected, actual)`  23  _the remote's `ref` was expected to be `expected` but is `actual`_  a `Push.Force.Lease` expectation was wrong
-         row  `NoteNotFound`  24  _no note was attached to the given object_
-         row  `NoSuchConfig(key)`  25  _the configuration key `key` is not set_  the committer's `user.name` or `user.email`, when a commit is made
-         row  `InvalidConfig(key, value)`  26  _`value` is not a valid value for `key`_
-         row  `BadSignature(detail)`  27  _the signature could not be verified: `detail`_
-         row  `SigningFailed(detail)`  28  _the object could not be signed: `detail`_
-         row  `Unsupported(operation)`  29  _`operation` is not supported by this backend_  also a concurrent exclusive open which was refused
-         row  `Unexpected`  30  _git reported an unexpected failure_  a failure the reason table does not know; git's message is kept as the error's `detail`
-         row  `NoteExists(target)`  31  _a note is already attached to `target`_
-         row  `NoSuchWorktree(path)`  32  _`path` is not a linked working tree_
-         row  `NoSuchStash`  33  _the stash entry does not exist_
-         row  `Locked(ref)`  34  _the lock file for `ref` is held by another process_
